                          | LBRACKET LT GT BACKQUOTE _bnf_polymorphic_variant_type_plus_7 RBRACKET
                          | LBRACKET LT RBRACKET

tag_spec_first: BACKQUOTE CAPITALIZED_IDENT OF typexpr
                | BACKQUOTE CAPITALIZED_IDENT
                | BACKQUOTE LOWERCASE_IDENT OF typexpr
                | BACKQUOTE LOWERCASE_IDENT
                | LBRACKET typexpr RBRACKET BAR tag_spec

tag_spec: BACKQUOTE CAPITALIZED_IDENT OF typexpr
          | BACKQUOTE CAPITALIZED_IDENT
          | BACKQUOTE LOWERCASE_IDENT OF typexpr
