          | typexpr

tag_spec_full: BACKQUOTE CAPITALIZED_IDENT OF AMP typexpr _bnf_tag_spec_full_star_9
               | BACKQUOTE CAPITALIZED_IDENT OF AMP typexpr
               | BACKQUOTE CAPITALIZED_IDENT OF typexpr _bnf_tag_spec_full_star_9
